    <!-- Fallback shown by ChangelogDialog only when no server notes match the installed build
         (fresh install / sideload). Rewrite changelog_current on every release, here and in
         values-in/string.xml; the name stays stable so no code has to change.

         Breaks MUST be \n escapes on a single line. AAPT normalises whitespace in string
         resources, so a literal newline in this XML compiles to a space — verified by
         `aapt2 dump strings` reporting zero newlines when this was written across lines. -->
    <string name="changelog_title">What\'s New in v%1$s</string>
    <string name="changelog_current">NEW\n• The witness signature now opens in its own window when you tap the signature box, giving a larger area to sign in. Clear and redo it there, then Save — or Cancel to keep the previous signature.\n\nFIXES\n• Scrolling the check-out form could leave stray marks on the signature box. Signing no longer shares the page with the scroll.\n\nNOTES\n• The witness name and signature are still required, the same as the photo. Check-out cannot be completed without both, so make sure the room PIC is present when the work finishes.\n• The name and signature are saved to the unit\'s maintenance history and can be seen on the AC dashboard on the web.</string>

